    cnw:editorialNote "(I.A.2.c. ‘Magnificat, mit Instrumenten, lateinische’): 'Scheibe, Maestro di Cap. di Ré di Damen. [sic] Magnificat, à 2 Oboi, 2 Violini, Viola, 4 Voci, Organo. a 1thl. 20 gl.'" ;
    cnw:editorialNote "(IV.[d]. ‘Magnificat. Lateinische [mit Instrumenten]’): 'Scheibe, Magnificat, à 2 Oboi, 2 Violini, Viole, 4 Voci, Violone. ed Organo. Part. 1 thl. St. 1 thl. 20 gl.'" ;
    cnw:editorialNote "There is no indication of instruments though they most likely are the same as the previous movement." ;
